vala-panel-appmenu (1:25.04-0caminito1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Caminito's patched vala-panel-appmenu, from Ubuntu 26.04's
    25.04+dfsg-3ubuntu1 (CMN-125).
  * Add epoch 1: 25.04-0caminito1 sorts below Ubuntu's 25.04+dfsg-3ubuntu1,
    and no stock version may satisfy Caminito's dependencies (ADR 0029).
  * Build from upstream's 25.04 tag, not repacked.
  * Build the MATE applet alone, on libwnck, as Arch's
    vala-panel-appmenu-mate-caminito does: drop xfce4-appmenu-plugin and
    vala-panel-appmenu, and their build dependencies.
  * Carry packaging/patches/vala-panel-appmenu/, the Caminito backend, the
    menu translator's fixes and the chord's shortcut. tools/debian-build
    copies it into debian/patches/.
  * Build-depend on libmate-panel-applet-dev (>= 1.29.0~), so that the
    applet links libmate-panel-applet-4.so.2.
  * Pin the binaries at their caminito version in
    /etc/apt/preferences.d/caminito-vala-panel-appmenu (ADR 0029).

